---
---
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Alignment Under Pressure Benchmark (AUPB)</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-color: #f8fafc;
        --text-main: #1e293b;
        --text-muted: #64748b;
        --accent: #0f172a;
        --accent-hover: #334155;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .wrapper {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        position: relative;
        padding: 0 2rem;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      /* Background Decoration */
      .bg-decor {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        z-index: -1;
        overflow: hidden;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .blob {
        position: absolute;
        width: 500px;
        height: 500px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8) 0%, rgba(226, 232, 240, 0) 70%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(60px);
        animation: float 20s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
      }
      .blob-1 { top: -10%; left: -10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
      .blob-2 { bottom: -10%; right: -10%; animation-delay: -5s; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.7) 0%, rgba(203, 213, 225, 0) 70%); }
      .blob-3 { top: 40%; left: 30%; width: 300px; height: 300px; animation-delay: -10s; opacity: 0.5; }

      @keyframes float {
        0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
        100% { transform: translate(50px, 100px) scale(1.1); }
      }

      .content {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        animation: fadeInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
        z-index: 10;
      }
      @keyframes fadeInUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        line-height: 1.1;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0f172a, #475569);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      }
      .description {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      .cta-container {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-family: inherit;
        transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background: var(--accent-hover);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3);
      }
      /* Modal Styles */
      .modal-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        z-index: 1000;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      }
      .modal-overlay.active {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      .modal-content {
        background: white;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 24px;
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 90%;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        transform: scale(0.95);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      }
      .modal-overlay.active .modal-content {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      .modal-title {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
      }
      .modal-body {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .modal-body p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .modal-body .warning {
        color: #dc2626;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .modal-footer {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .modal-image {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 550px;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }

      .auth-section {
        position: relative;
        padding-top: 2.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        display: inline-block;
        max-width: 550px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .auth-text {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .auth-text strong {
        color: var(--text-main);
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      footer {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 2rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .footer-links {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      .link-item {
        color: #9ca3af;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .link-item:hover {
        color: #64748b;
      }
      .copyright {
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      /* Wave Animation */
      .waves {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 15vh;
        min-height: 100px;
        max-height: 150px;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .parallax > use {
        animation: move-forever 25s cubic-bezier(.55,.5,.45,.5) infinite;
      }
      .parallax > use:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: -2s; animation-duration: 7s; }
      .parallax > use:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -3s; animation-duration: 10s; }
      .parallax > use:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: -4s; animation-duration: 13s; }
      .parallax > use:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: -5s; animation-duration: 20s; }
      @keyframes move-forever {
        0% { transform: translate3d(-// 0,0,0); }
        100% { transform: translate3d(100%,0,0); }
      }
      /*- Fix for translation -*/
      @keyframes move-forever-fixed {
        0% { transform: translate3d(-90vw,0,0); }
        100% { transform: translate3d(85vw,0,0); }
      }
      .parallax > use {
        animation: move-forever-fixed 25s cubic-bezier(.55,.5,.45,.5) infinite;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="bg-decor">
      <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
      <div class="blob blob-2"></div>
      <div class="blob blob-3"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Alignment Under Pressure Benchmark</h1>
        <p class="description">
          AIモデルが外部からの圧力や文脈的な影響を受けた状況において、<br>
          真実性・一貫性・信頼性を維持できるかを評価するベンチマーク。
        </p>
         <div class="cta-container">
           <button id="open-modal" class="cta-button">
             招待済みの方
           </button>
         </div>
        <div class="auth-section">
          <div class="auth-text">
            <strong>プレビューへのアクセスについて</strong>
            この研究を閲覧するには認証が必要です。<br>
            招待されている場合は、上記のボタン・指定の方法でアクセスしてください。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/Akikukeo1" class="link-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB</a>
          <a href="https://akikukeo1.github.io" class="link-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WEBSITE</a>
        </div>
        <div class="copyright">© 2026 Keisuke Ishii</div>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <div class="waves">
      <svg class="waves-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
      viewBox="0 24 150 28" preserveAspectRatio="none" shape-rendering="auto">
        <defs>
          <path id="gentle-wave" d="M-160 44c30 0 58-18 88-18s58 18 88 18 58-18 88-18 58 18 88 18 v24h-352z" />
        </defs>
        <g class="parallax">
          <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="0" fill="rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.7)" />
          <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="3" fill="rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.5)" />
          <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="5" fill="rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.3)" />
          <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="7" fill="#f8fafc" />
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div id="info-modal" class="modal-overlay">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-title">操作説明</div>
        <div class="modal-body">
          <img src="/Gemini_Generated_Image_nc8nownc8nownc8n.png" alt="注意喚起" class="modal-image" />
          <p>この先のページでは、あらかじめお伝えしたパスワードを入力してください。</p>
          <p>広告が出ますので、間違ってクリックしないようにしてください。</p>
          <p class="warning">フィッシング広告が表示されることがありますが、絶対に押さないでください。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer">
          <a href="https://x.gd/Q4ibw" class="cta-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            アクセス
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script>
      const openModalBtn = document.getElementById('open-modal');
      const modal = document.getElementById('info-modal');

      openModalBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        modal?.classList.add('active');
      });

      modal?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target === modal) {
          modal.classList.remove('active');
        }
      });
    </script>
  </body>

</html>
